    "detailed_description": "Stay Alive is a game with simple gameplay, designed in retro pixel art style, with elements of mythology and roguelite.<br><br>Sometimes running away isn't the solution, but sometimes you shouldn't even look back, and giving up isn't always the end.<br>What will you do? Do you trust your decisions, can your choices keep you alive?<br>Try to survive against hundreds of enemies whose origins are unknown. They only want one thing. To. Destroy. You.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast runs (Max. 30 min).<br></li><li>Over 50 achievements.<br></li><li>Over 15 characters and weapons.<br></li><li>Upgrade your weapons, passives and characters.<br></li><li>Evolve your weapons and cause even more chaos.<br></li><li>Fight against powerful bosses that have random skills.<br></li><li>Refundable upgrades for casual gamers.</li></ul><br>Stay Alive is a roguelite survival game inspired by <i>Vampire Survivors</i> and <i>Path of Exile</i>.",
